; Her writing desk: a small table with drawers, a pile of books (her diary among them),
; a letter being written and a lamp that turns on at night. Clicking it opens her letters
; and her diary. The Kenney models have their origin at a corner, so each one is moved
; to center the desk on this node. Its front faces local +Z.

